Error [jet.IrreversibleNotAFact]: This `fn irreversible` body is not an effect fact
  --> tests/ui/effects/effect_irreversible_body_is_not_a_fact.jet:6:41
    |
  6 |         fn irreversible(self) -> Bool { self != .Read }
    |                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The compiler reads `irreversible` without running it, so its body is `true`, `false`, `self == .Case` or an `||` of those, naming cases of `Ledger`
 Fix: Write `{ true }`, `{ false }` or `{ self == .Write }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0633
